    {"type":"TRUE_FALSE","outcome_code":"10-CBSE-SOC-CIV-PS-05","difficulty":"EASY","cognitive_level":"UNDERSTAND","marks":1,"question":"The PRUDENTIAL reason for power-sharing focuses on the spirit of democracy.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","explanation":"Prudential = consequences; moral = spirit."},
